{"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Building Hierarchies","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AncestorsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/DescendantsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CyclicHierarchy","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/HierarchyError"],"anchor":"Building-Hierarchies"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/RelatingEntities","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Link entities to one another, build trees of parents and children, and query entities by what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they’re linked to."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relatingentities"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Relating Entities","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some state belongs to a pair of entities rather than to one: a unit likes another, a turret aims"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at a ship, a button sits on a panel. A "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"relation","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" stores that kind of link, and the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"hierarchy","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the relation that makes trees of parents and children."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Link Entities with Relations","type":"heading","anchor":"Link-Entities-with-Relations"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Declare a relation as a type that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation"},{"text":", then link a source entity to a target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/relate(_:_:to:)"},{"text":" and unlink it with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/unrelate(_:_:from:)"},{"text":". Read the links in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"either direction: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/targets(_:of:)"},{"text":" lists what a source relates to, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/sources(_:of:)"},{"text":" lists what relates to a target.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A relation can carry values, one per link, such as the amount one entity owes another. It","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"chooses two behaviors with static properties:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/isExclusive","type":"reference"},{"text":" limits a source to one target, so relating it to a new target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"replaces the old one.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/onTargetDespawn","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" says what despawning a target does to its sources: remove their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"links, the default, or despawn them too.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A source holds its links in a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" component, which you read and filter on like any other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component. To visit only the sources of one target, filter a query with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".related(_:to:)"},{"type":"text","text":", which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"uses the world’s index of each target’s sources rather than walking every source."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Build a Hierarchy","type":"heading","anchor":"Build-a-Hierarchy"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The hierarchy is the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","type":"reference"},{"text":" relation: exclusive, so each entity has at most one parent, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"despawning a parent despawns its children, and theirs in turn. Spawn an entity under a parent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/spawn(_:childOf:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", or move an existing one with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/addChild(_:to:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"throws ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CyclicHierarchy","type":"reference"},{"text":" rather than make an entity its own ancestor. Walk the tree with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/parent(of:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/children(of:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/ancestors(of:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/descendants(of:)","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because the hierarchy is a relation, the same query filters work on it:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".related(ChildOf.self, to: ship)"},{"text":" visits the children of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ship"},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".without(Targets<ChildOf>.self)"},{"text":" visits the roots.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example aims a ship’s turret at a comet, then at a moon, and despawns the ship"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with its turret:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct AimsAt: Relation {","    static var isExclusive: Bool { true }","}","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Name(value: \"ship\"))","let turret = world.spawn(Name(value: \"turret\"), childOf: ship)","let comet = world.spawn(Name(value: \"comet\"))","let moon = world.spawn(Name(value: \"moon\"))","","world.relate(turret, AimsAt(), to: comet)","world.relate(turret, AimsAt(), to: moon)","print(world.targets(AimsAt.self, of: turret) == [moon])","\/\/ Prints \"true\"","","world.despawn(ship)","print(world.contains(turret), world.sources(AimsAt.self, of: moon).isEmpty)","\/\/ Prints \"false true\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Observers of an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" that propagates also use the hierarchy: the event moves from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity it was triggered on up to each of its ancestors. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" record changes to relations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and to the hierarchy, to apply after a query or update."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/unrelate(_:_:from:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Removes the link between a source entity and a target entity and returns its value."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/unrelate(_:_:from:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/unrelate(_:_:from:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"unrelate"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"title":"unrelate(_:_:from:)"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Commands":{"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/commands","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Commands"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Commands"}],"role":"sy